## Rules that are easy to break
1. <invarianti del codice>
2. Scripts write to files and print at most 5 lines; long runs only through `harness/scripts/windows/Run-Timed.ps1`.
3. Never commit the owner's local files: the pre-commit guard (`kit.config.json` > `guard`) blocks them.

## Build and run
- Build: `powershell -File harness/scripts/windows/Run-Timed.ps1 -Preset Build -Log Saved/Logs/ci/build.log`
- Tests: `... -Preset Test -Log Saved/Logs/ci/test.log` then `harness/scripts/windows/Check-TestLog.ps1 -UeLog Saved/Logs/ci/test.log.ue.log`
- Editor questions: `python harness/scripts/python/ask_unreal_assistant.py "question"`

## Git
Agents work on `claude/*` branches only; the owner merges. Commit messages: short imperative subject, body with the reason.
